{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26026","headline":"秋思三首 二 · 鲍溶","name":"秋思三首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"顾兔蚀残月，幽光不如星。\n女儿晚事夫，颜色同秋萤。\n秋日边马思，武夫不遑宁。\n燕歌易水怨，劒舞蛟龙腥。\n风折连枝树，水翻无蔕萍。\n立身多门户，何必燕山铭。\n生世不如鸟，双双比翼翎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26026.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26026","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}